      "side": 1,
      "message": "There is another rules for srcs generation:\ngensrcs\n\nSee already implemented example in [topshim](https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/gd/rust/topshim/Android.bp;l\u003d77;drc\u003dc098551094ddd6107c0ac4f94e91b2cdbfe03428)\n\nThe big advantage is you don\u0027t need to list all out files. \nThe second advantage is that you cmd is readable again :\n`cmd: \"$(location cxxbridge) $(in) \u003e $(out)\",`\nand\n`cmd: \"$(location cxxbridge) $(in) --header \u003e $(out)\",`\n\n\nand if we want to keep them in sync",
